From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean McCully <sean_mccully@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 13:40:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: mt7530: MT7988 internal switch bring-up improvements

Improve MT7988 built-in switch (gsw) handling: wait for the internal
GbE PHYs to finish calibration before DSA setup (avoids a probe race
where ports come up dead after a cold boot), add pause statistics
reporting, provide a preferred default local CPU port selection and
fill the available-PCS array for phylink. Carry the vendor generic
netlink register-access implementation in a multi-object build for
follow-up integration; its family registration is not wired up yet.

Signed-off-by: Sean McCully <sean_mccully@yahoo.com>
